It("c4","Boot","retrieval",608,277,"Luggage you can load and check before you set off.","Retrieval: the agent looks things up in a store of your documents before answering. This is RAG (retrieval-augmented generation).",["Postgres with pgvector","Supabase","Pinecone"],{pt:[556,172],ls:[600,258]})
],
