intro:{name:"Inside the cabin: the harness",car:"The cabin is everything you touch: wheel, dashboard, satnav, seat settings, handbrake and the safety kit.",ai:"This is the harness. It turns a raw engine into something you can steer. The same engine in a different cabin feels like a different car.",p:["Claude Code","Claude app","ChatGPT","Cursor","Codex","Gemini CLI"]},
