It("k1","The driving loop",null,150,60,"Look at the road, decide, steer, check the mirror, repeat.","The agent loop: the model reads the situation, picks an action, uses a tool, sees the result and goes again until the job is done.",["Claude Code","Claude Cowork","ChatGPT Work","Codex"]),
